{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WTrnDRcRXhC93TB4kor9UU","type":"tool_result","content":"# Build from spec: the Cyclops viewer API\n\nThis repository is a real application with its HTTP layer removed. `cyclops/ui/server.py` is a scaffold: `create_app(store, users)` answers an app with\nno routes. Rebuild it so the app serves the API that `spec.py` describes (the CONTRACTS: method, path, parameters, auth,\ndeclared errors), using the modules already in the repository (`cyclops/ui/store.py`: the read-only artefact reader; `cyclops/ui/user_store.py`: the `/api/user/*` writes).\n\n- The gate is `./check.sh` (the Lattice check of `spec.py`).\n- Change only `cyclops/ui/server.py`. The spec files, `harness.py`, `check.sh`, `studio.toml`, this file and every other source file are\n  protected; an edit to them fails the build.\n#!/bin/sh\n# The gate: the Lattice check of spec.py (layers ABCDR) on the app. Exit 0 = clean.\nset -e\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\nexec python -m lattice.spec check --spec spec:SPEC --app harness:make_app --db harness:build_db --layers ABCDR --app-dir cyclops/ui --package cyclops.ui \"$@\"\n__init__.py\ncli.py\nconfig.py\ndata\ndirection\neod\nfeatures\nheadroom.py\nlive\nmemory\npatterns\nregime\nresearch_rungs.py\nslotexpect.py\nslotvol.py\ntrades\nui\nvalidate\nvol\n\ncyclops/data:\n__init__.py\nbulk_fetch.py\nclean.py\ncontinuous.py\ncontracts.py\ndollar.py\ndq.py\nload.py\npipeline.py\nresample.py\nroll.py\nsessions.py\nstore.py\ntopup.py\n\ncyclops/direction:\n__init__.py\nanchors.py\nconditioning.py\nmechanical.py\nmodel.py\npanel.py\nreport.py\nrules.py\nstress.py\ntargets.py\n\ncyclops/eod:\n__init__.py\n\"\"\"FastAPI binding over `Store` and `UserStore`: the viewer's HTTP surface (to be rebuilt from spec.py).\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\nfrom cyclops.ui.store import Store\nfrom cyclops.ui.user_store import UserStore\n\n\ndef create_app(store: Store | None = None, users: UserStore | None = None) -> FastAPI:\n    \"\"\"Build the FastAPI app bound to one `Store` (one artifact root) and its `UserStore`.\"\"\"\n    if store is None:\n        store = Store()\n    if users is None:\n        users = UserStore(store.root)\n    app = FastAPI(title=\"cyclops\")\n    return app","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"25e55146-d7ad-4b00-9b04-b33f1b7f87c0","uuid":"77ccf7c1-eace-4231-846a-9b2972353968","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:04:19.742Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Build from spec: the Cyclops viewer API\n\nThis repository is a real application with its HTTP layer removed. `cyclops/ui/server.py` is a scaffold: `create_app(store, users)` answers an app with\nno routes. Rebuild it so the app serves the API that `spec.py` describes (the CONTRACTS: method, path, parameters, auth,\ndeclared errors), using the modules already in the repository (`cyclops/ui/store.py`: the read-only artefact reader; `cyclops/ui/user_store.py`: the `/api/user/*` writes).\n\n- The gate is `./check.sh` (the Lattice check of `spec.py`).\n- Change only `cyclops/ui/server.py`. The spec files, `harness.py`, `check.sh`, `studio.toml`, this file and every other source file are\n  protected; an edit to them fails the build.\n#!/bin/sh\n# The gate: the Lattice check of spec.py (layers ABCDR) on the app. Exit 0 = clean.\nset -e\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\nexec python -m lattice.spec check --spec spec:SPEC --app harness:make_app --db harness:build_db --layers ABCDR --app-dir cyclops/ui --package cyclops.ui \"$@\"\n__init__.py\ncli.py\nconfig.py\ndata\ndirection\neod\nfeatures\nheadroom.py\nlive\nmemory\npatterns\nregime\nresearch_rungs.py\nslotexpect.py\nslotvol.py\ntrades\nui\nvalidate\nvol\n\ncyclops/data:\n__init__.py\nbulk_fetch.py\nclean.py\ncontinuous.py\ncontracts.py\ndollar.py\ndq.py\nload.py\npipeline.py\nresample.py\nroll.py\nsessions.py\nstore.py\ntopup.py\n\ncyclops/direction:\n__init__.py\nanchors.py\nconditioning.py\nmechanical.py\nmodel.py\npanel.py\nreport.py\nrules.py\nstress.py\ntargets.py\n\ncyclops/eod:\n__init__.py\n\"\"\"FastAPI binding over `Store` and `UserStore`: the viewer's HTTP surface (to be rebuilt from spec.py).\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\nfrom cyclops.ui.store import Store\nfrom cyclops.ui.user_store import UserStore\n\n\ndef create_app(store: Store | None = None, users: UserStore | None = None) -> FastAPI:\n    \"\"\"Build the FastAPI app bound to one `Store` (one artifact root) and its `UserStore`.\"\"\"\n    if store is None:\n        store = Store()\n    if users is None:\n        users = UserStore(store.root)\n    app = FastAPI(title=\"cyclops\")\n    return app","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WTrnDRcRXhC93TB4kor9UU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
